usage: releases jog run [-h] [--target-root TARGET_ROOT] [--auto-merge]
                        [--builder BUILDER] [--reviewer REVIEWER]
                        [--executor {relay,marathon}] [--max-tasks MAX_TASKS]
                        [--simulate] [--dry-run]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --target-root TARGET_ROOT
                        disposable full execution clone (required for
                        dispatch)
  --auto-merge          opt-in to auto-merge passing PRs on same-seam tasks
  --builder BUILDER     builder turn-taker (default: agy; or codex, aider)
  --reviewer REVIEWER   reviewer agent — REQUIRED with --executor marathon,
                        the default executor (GH-280 Phase 5); no default is
                        selected
  --executor {relay,marathon}
                        per-task executor (GH-280 Phase 5): 'marathon' is the
                        default — the reviewed one-phase driver via the
                        structured contracts, requires --reviewer; 'relay' is
                        the legacy rollback path kept for a documented
                        compatibility window
  --max-tasks MAX_TASKS
                        maximum tasks to process in this run
  --simulate            simulate drive execution in test environments
  --dry-run             simulate queue run without mutations
